    "chunk_text": "niwe gate cyse \u00fe\u00e6rto gewri\u00feen, hyt h\u00e6le\u00fe. Wi\u00f0 fotadle, gate cyse niwe on gelegd \u00fe\u00e6t sar geli\u00f0ega\u00f0. Wi\u00f0 n\u00e6dran slite, sceaf gate horn on \u00fery scenceas & \u00feare ylcan gate meolc wi\u00f0 wine gemencgede on Syllice hyt \u00fe\u00e6t attor tosceade\u00fe. Wi\u00f0 inno\u00f0es flewsan, gate horn gesceafen & wi\u00f0 hunige gemencged & gecweden & \u00e6fter \u00feam Wi\u00f0 hreofe & wi\u00f0 toflogen lic, genim \u00fe\u00e6t w\u00e6ter \u00fee innan g\u00e6t by\u00fe & heo hwilum ut geote\u00f0. Menge \u00feone w\u00e6tan wi\u00f0 hunige & sealte, & symle on \u00e6fenne his heafod & his lic mid \u00fey \u00fewea & Wi\u00f0 inno\u00f0es heardnysse, swa hw\u00e6t swa he ete menge wi\u00f0 \u00feone w\u00e6tan & \u00feone ylcan drince wi\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6s Swa he ma drince\u00f0, swa hyt fur\u00f0or cl\u00e6nsa\u00f0. Wi\u00f0 \u00feone w\u00e6tan, do him eac drince gate blod. Wel \u00fe\u00e6t hyne h\u00e6le\u00f0. Gif inno\u00f0 \u00feinde, nim gate blod mid hyre smeorwe & berene gryta gemeng, & on wambe utan gewri\u00f0. Wundorlice hyt h\u00e6l\u00fe. Wi\u00f0 \u00e6lces cynnes n\u00e6ddran bite, gate smeoro & hyre tord & weax mylt & gemeng tosomne, wyrc swa Onfo se \u00fee him \u00f0earf sy, \u00feonne bi\u00f0 he geh\u00e6led. \u00dee man se \u00fee him seo w\u00e6teradl, g\u00e6ten smeoro ge\u00feyd to poslum swelge, & drince mid ceald w\u00e6ter, & Hym by\u00fe hr\u00e6d bot. Drince eft buccan micgan & ete nardes ear & w\u00e6lwyrte mor",
